@Automacao.DuamApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5043

### Enfileira o processamento de uma planilha (assíncrono)
# Retorna 202 Accepted com o jobId — o processamento roda em background (Hangfire).
POST {{Automacao.DuamApi_HostAddress}}/duam/processar
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----DuamBoundary

------DuamBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Usuario"

meu.usuario
------DuamBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Senha"

minha.senha
------DuamBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Planilha"; filename="planilha.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./planilha.xlsx
------DuamBoundary--

###

### Consulta o status/progresso/resultado de um job
GET {{Automacao.DuamApi_HostAddress}}/duam/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### Lista o histórico de jobs (paginado, filtros opcionais)
GET {{Automacao.DuamApi_HostAddress}}/duam/jobs?pagina=1&tamanhoPagina=20
Accept: application/json

###
